// some of the files and directories that git should ignore while pushing them to ur git as they are available in ur project in npm. 

// this is a file that holds those file u don't need in ur git. 
// Rem u can only ignor what is untracked, and has to be a file or directories
// NOTE u can ignore files that are: Automatically generated, Personal or local to your machine, 
// Contain secrets, and Files Not needed for others to run the project
// NOTE with this .gitignore, u can't commit anything or file being ignored

/node_modules